WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
From a low lunge, straighten the front leg and shift the hips back.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Flex the front foot, toes pointing up.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Walk the hands back beside the front hip onto blocks.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Hinge forward over the straight leg with a long spine. Switch sides.
